    "finding": "Matching camera framing retains native crowns, roots, source colors and AO; no giant placeholders or obvious holes in inspected motion frames. NPC locations can differ because the deterministic 600ms world continues during routes with different wall-clock durations. Shadow-only proxy has separate hard 0.9 IoU acceptance tests."
